## Famíla ##


<div class="col50p terminal example">
font-family: serif;


font-family: sans-serif;


font-family: monospace;

</div>
<div class=col50p style="margin-bottom: -50px;">
<p style="font-family: serif;">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</p>
<p style="font-family: sans-serif;">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</p>
<p style="font-family: monospace;">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet</p>

</div>


* Propriedade <code class=focus>font-family</code> controla família de tipos
* Pode tomar como valores
    * família genérica
        * <code class=focus>serif</code>,
	<code class=focus>sans-serif</code>,
	<code class=focus>cursive</code>,
	<code class=focus>fantasy</code>,
	<code class=focus>monospace</code>,
    * nome de família	
        * <code class=focus>time</code>, <code class=focus>courier</code>,
	 <code class=focus>arial</code>, ...